            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Vera Rubin</strong><br>\nVera Rubin was born on July 23, 1928, in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania. From a young age, she was fascinated by the night sky, spending hours watching the stars from her bedroom window. Her interest in astronomy grew when she began observing the stars through a telescope given to her by her parents. Despite facing challenges as a woman in a male-dominated field, she pursued her passion and earned a bachelor's degree in astronomy from Vassar College.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Education Path</strong><br>\nAfter graduating as the only astronomy major in her class at Vassar College in 1948, Rubin encountered barriers to her further education because she was a woman. She was rejected from Princeton's graduate program, which did not accept female students until 1975. Undeterred, she attended Cornell University, where she earned her master's degree, and later obtained a Ph.D. from Georgetown University, where she studied under George Gamow.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Beginning of Her Career</strong><br>\nRubin's early career was marked by a search for academic positions and grant funding, a struggle common among female scientists of her time. Her research at the Department of Terrestrial Magnetism at the Carnegie Institution of Washington allowed her to explore her interests in galaxy motions. Here, she began the work on galaxy rotation rates that would eventually make her famous.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
